WEBVTT

00:00:04.635 --> 00:00:07.430
Revolutionary Calendar, year 228.

00:00:07.638 --> 00:00:09.515
After the battle of Slonim,

00:00:09.724 --> 00:00:12.560
Leila, Akito and the others
were stranded in Warsaw,

00:00:12.768 --> 00:00:15.604
where their experiences
deepened their bonds of trust.

00:00:15.813 --> 00:00:20.443
Meanwhile, riots engulfed Europia
as a result of a cunning scheme

00:00:20.651 --> 00:00:23.779
by Britannia's military advisor, Julius Kingsley.

00:00:23.988 --> 00:00:29.410
Akito and the others leave for the Ark
to prevent a Britannian invasion.

00:00:29.660 --> 00:00:31.954
"1,000 kilometers south of Saint Petersburg"”

00:00:32.830 --> 00:00:34.749
"Euro Britannian Territory
Dnieper Upland"

00:00:34.749 --> 00:00:35.249
"Euro Britannian Territory
Dnieper Upland" Course is clear.

00:00:35.249 --> 00:00:36.000
Course is clear.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:36.584
"Holy Order of Michael Forward
operating base" Course is clear.

00:00:36.584 --> 00:00:36.792
"Holy Order of Michael
Forward operating base"

00:00:36.792 --> 00:00:39.128
<i>"Holy Order of Michael Forward operating base" You will
be able to reach altitude of 10,000 meters in one go.</i>

00:00:39.128 --> 00:00:40.504
You will be able to reach altitude
of 10,000 meters in one go.

00:00:41.756 --> 00:00:43.674
A Float System, eh?

00:00:44.675 --> 00:00:46.469
The homeland isn't to be trifled with, I see.

00:00:47.470 --> 00:00:49.638
Commencing countdown.

00:00:49.847 --> 00:00:52.683
Destination coordinates entry complete.

00:00:52.892 --> 00:00:55.811
Auto-nav system activation confirmed.

00:01:45.611 --> 00:01:48.823
Hilda, Chloe, give me a final check
on the Alexander Variants.

00:01:49.031 --> 00:01:50.324
Everything's okay, Boss!

00:01:50.533 --> 00:01:52.159
They're working perfectly!

00:01:52.368 --> 00:01:55.913
T-minus 8 minutes to liftoff!
Countdown to liftoff has commenced!

00:01:56.122 --> 00:01:58.165
All systems nominal!

00:01:59.667 --> 00:02:03.462
Joe Wise, better safe than sorry. Confirm BRS.

00:02:03.671 --> 00:02:06.465
It looks fine, Dr. Randle.

00:02:06.674 --> 00:02:09.260
--10, 9, 8.
--Make sure you come home safely.

00:02:09.468 --> 00:02:12.680
-7,6,5.
--Let's keep our fingers crossed...

00:02:12.888 --> 00:02:16.559
-4, 3,2, 1.
--All systems ready!

00:02:16.767 --> 00:02:18.644
Main engine start!

00:02:39.081 --> 00:02:43.169
So, that's Apollo's Chariot... It's beautiful.

00:02:50.593 --> 00:02:53.220
T-minus 30 seconds to fairing separation.

00:02:53.429 --> 00:02:56.682
27, 26, 25.

00:03:03.856 --> 00:03:08.569
Capsule reentry in 10 seconds! 8! 7!

00:03:14.158 --> 00:03:16.744
"Over the North Sea"

00:03:18.996 --> 00:03:24.335
| know you're coming... Akito Hyuga.

00:03:39.475 --> 00:03:42.394
Separation from capsules successful!
All units confirmed!

00:03:42.603 --> 00:03:44.813
All Alexanders show green!

00:03:56.492 --> 00:03:59.286
Wyvern Squad has detected the Ark!

00:03:59.495 --> 00:04:00.829
Commencing countdown!

00:04:01.038 --> 00:04:03.791
25! 24! 23!

00:04:03.999 --> 00:04:06.210
22! 21!

00:04:39.910 --> 00:04:43.581
High-altitude observation balloon
has a lock on Wyvern Squad!

00:04:44.748 --> 00:04:48.002
It. Hyuga has arrived at the Ark!

00:04:48.210 --> 00:04:49.920
Does this seem strange to you?

00:04:51.880 --> 00:04:52.798
Continuing to close in!

00:04:53.007 --> 00:04:55.884
Ark interior scan data received!

00:04:57.261 --> 00:04:59.388
Capt. Clement!

00:04:59.597 --> 00:05:03.392
I've analyzed the data, but it's strange.

00:05:03.601 --> 00:05:04.643
How so?

00:05:04.852 --> 00:05:08.063
Its mass is too small in relation to its volume.

00:05:08.272 --> 00:05:10.065
It's almost as if...

00:05:10.274 --> 00:05:12.109
It's as if it's hollow.

00:05:13.110 --> 00:05:15.029
Wyvern Squad is requesting
weapons authorization!

00:05:15.237 --> 00:05:17.906
The Alexanders' power plants
have gone to combat output!

00:05:20.034 --> 00:05:21.869
| was wondering if anyone was home!

00:05:26.707 --> 00:05:29.084
There's more than I thought.

00:05:29.293 --> 00:05:31.128
They appear to be engaging the enemy!

00:05:31.337 --> 00:05:33.631
Engaging who? And how many?

00:05:33.839 --> 00:05:35.507
Still analyzing data!

00:05:39.303 --> 00:05:43.390
Master Ashley... Good luck to you.

00:05:46.143 --> 00:05:50.481
Joannes, I bet you're lonely
over there all by yourself.

00:05:50.689 --> 00:05:52.566
--Master Ashley!
--Master Ashley!

00:05:52.775 --> 00:05:55.861
Why?! Why can't we go with you?!

00:05:56.070 --> 00:05:58.781
--We'll go with you!
--Master Ashley!

00:05:58.989 --> 00:06:00.658
Don't make me repeat myself!

00:06:00.866 --> 00:06:02.826
<i>I'm going alone!</i>

00:06:03.827 --> 00:06:07.915
Just you wait... I'll avenge you.

00:06:08.123 --> 00:06:10.000
Mark my words!

00:06:11.835 --> 00:06:12.753
This is...

00:06:12.961 --> 00:06:15.214
Commander! Emergency
transmission from Joint HQ!

00:06:15.422 --> 00:06:17.633
Joint HQ? Who is it from?

00:06:17.841 --> 00:06:20.511
It's a direct line from Gen. Smilas!

00:06:22.012 --> 00:06:23.847
Put it on the main screen!

00:06:24.056 --> 00:06:25.974
Thank goodness you're safe, Gen. Smilas.

00:06:26.183 --> 00:06:27.601
| am, anyway.

00:06:27.810 --> 00:06:30.979
But the government and military
are no longer functioning.

00:06:31.188 --> 00:06:33.857
The city of Paris is one big riot.

00:06:34.066 --> 00:06:36.944
Nevertheless, I will not flee.

00:06:37.152 --> 00:06:41.115
General, the cause of the riots, the Ark Fleet,

00:06:41.323 --> 00:06:43.784
is a plot concocted by
the Euro Britannian Army.

00:06:43.992 --> 00:06:45.619
Can you prove that?

00:06:45.828 --> 00:06:50.666
A mission is underway to get
the Wyvern Squad onto the Ark.

00:06:50.874 --> 00:06:54.169
We also have confirmation that they
are engaging Britannian Knightmares.

00:06:54.378 --> 00:06:57.631
We must tell the people of Europia
what we have learned!

00:06:57.840 --> 00:07:00.843
Laying out the facts at
this point might not help...

00:07:02.845 --> 00:07:03.846
Leila.

00:07:04.054 --> 00:07:07.516
People are always looking for an
opportunity to vent their frustrations.

00:07:07.725 --> 00:07:09.476
It's human nature.

00:07:09.685 --> 00:07:13.897
But there must still be a chance!

00:07:15.482 --> 00:07:18.694
If it comes from you, it might work.

00:07:19.778 --> 00:07:24.158
You should have the words in you
that will get through to them.

00:07:25.951 --> 00:07:30.539
After all, you are the daughter
of Bradow Von Breisgau.

00:07:36.503 --> 00:07:40.299
If there are Knightmares here,
it means Britannia is behind this!

00:07:41.508 --> 00:07:43.010
Ayano!

00:07:44.928 --> 00:07:47.556
Damn, they're quick to turn tail, ain't they?!

00:07:58.525 --> 00:08:00.110
This thing is a...

00:08:12.164 --> 00:08:13.999
Those are drones!

00:08:19.296 --> 00:08:21.673
They must not think much of us!

00:08:28.305 --> 00:08:31.225
There's a ton of these things!
Hey! Do you read me?

00:08:47.074 --> 00:08:48.951
It's about time.

00:08:49.159 --> 00:08:51.537
| was getting sick of waiting!

00:09:11.139 --> 00:09:13.100
I'll blow you away!

00:09:23.986 --> 00:09:25.696
Die!

00:09:29.449 --> 00:09:31.034
Akito!

00:09:39.960 --> 00:09:41.461
Ryo!

00:09:47.384 --> 00:09:51.013
Die! Die!

00:09:55.559 --> 00:09:57.060
That's...

00:09:59.187 --> 00:10:02.566
It's that red Knightmare... I don't believe it!

00:10:08.155 --> 00:10:10.365
Schrotter Steel armor?!

00:10:12.284 --> 00:10:16.371
People of Europia, there is
something that I must tell you.

00:10:16.580 --> 00:10:19.041
Please understand how foolish it is

00:10:19.249 --> 00:10:23.045
to start rioting in response to
Britannian media manipulation.

00:10:23.253 --> 00:10:26.882
We are a unit that fights
Euro Britannia covertly.

00:10:27.090 --> 00:10:29.301
--We're connected!
--Link to all of Europia confirmed!

00:10:29.509 --> 00:10:30.928
What's more, our soldiers,
the ones fighting on the front lines,

00:10:30.928 --> 00:10:33.347
"United Republic of Europia Paris” What's more,
our soldiers, the ones fighting on the front lines,

00:10:33.347 --> 00:10:33.388
"United Republic of Europia
Paris"

00:10:33.555 --> 00:10:35.265
are the people we call Elevens

00:10:35.474 --> 00:10:39.978
and keep segregated in
internment camps: Japanese.

00:10:40.187 --> 00:10:46.109
Out of fear of Britannia, we are robbing
the Japanese of their freedom.

00:10:52.282 --> 00:10:55.369
You're not getting away from me! I'll kill you!

00:10:58.413 --> 00:11:00.165
He's after Akito!

00:11:00.374 --> 00:11:02.876
Yukiya! Ryo! Cover me!

00:11:05.295 --> 00:11:06.797
Ayano?!

00:11:13.220 --> 00:11:15.347
It's all yours, Akito!

00:11:15.555 --> 00:11:18.475
Britannia's flying weapon does not exist.

00:11:18.684 --> 00:11:22.688
After controlling the people of Europia
with fear and causing them to riot,

00:11:22.896 --> 00:11:25.649
they will invade and occupy us militarily.

00:11:26.650 --> 00:11:28.485
Normal rounds won't work, huh?

00:11:29.987 --> 00:11:31.488
Let's try these.

00:11:41.289 --> 00:11:43.125
Die, damn it!

00:11:48.380 --> 00:11:50.132
Are you kidding me?!

00:11:50.340 --> 00:11:52.092
You're pissing me off!

00:12:04.104 --> 00:12:06.398
Oh, no you don't!

00:12:14.614 --> 00:12:16.825
Why do we hurt one another?

00:12:28.211 --> 00:12:32.257
Are human beings really that sad?

00:12:32.466 --> 00:12:34.092
Die...

00:12:35.469 --> 00:12:36.970
Die!

00:12:38.555 --> 00:12:41.266
We mustn't be ruled by hatred!

00:12:43.060 --> 00:12:45.353
Go to hell!

00:12:50.567 --> 00:12:51.943
Akito!

00:12:52.152 --> 00:12:55.655
We should have freedom in all respects.

00:13:06.583 --> 00:13:07.834
Die!

00:13:08.043 --> 00:13:11.254
However, with freedom comes responsibility.

00:13:11.463 --> 00:13:13.131
Die!

00:13:15.592 --> 00:13:17.761
So that we may live like human beings!

00:13:20.388 --> 00:13:23.058
So that we may make this world a better place!

00:13:23.266 --> 00:13:24.851
Die!

00:13:32.692 --> 00:13:35.570
My father, Bradow Von Breisgau,
believed that this

00:13:35.779 --> 00:13:39.491
was the freedom championed by Europia.

00:13:39.699 --> 00:13:42.744
Die... Die!

00:13:44.246 --> 00:13:45.747
This is...

00:13:47.624 --> 00:13:49.835
--It's happening again!
--Die!

00:13:50.836 --> 00:13:53.004
No! Akito!

00:13:54.464 --> 00:13:56.383
I'm seeing a spike in
Akito's brainwave pattern!

00:13:56.591 --> 00:13:58.468
The neuro-devices are out of control!

00:13:58.677 --> 00:14:01.179
The BRS has activated?

00:14:01.388 --> 00:14:04.015
Joe Wise! Record it!

00:14:04.224 --> 00:14:06.601
Dr. Randle, there's no time!

00:14:06.810 --> 00:14:08.728
Die!

00:14:13.525 --> 00:14:15.402
Die!

00:14:25.412 --> 00:14:27.873
You damn angel of death!

00:14:29.416 --> 00:14:30.917
Die.

00:14:38.300 --> 00:14:40.844
Die!

00:14:43.638 --> 00:14:46.099
You won't take me!

00:14:58.862 --> 00:15:00.447
Die.

00:15:01.448 --> 00:15:03.158
Don't do it, Akito!

00:15:18.381 --> 00:15:20.133
Joannes...

00:15:21.551 --> 00:15:24.346
You killed Joannes!

00:15:40.779 --> 00:15:43.073
Kill me, go on!

00:15:43.281 --> 00:15:47.369
Kill me like you killed Joannes, angel of death!

00:15:47.577 --> 00:15:49.204
Die.

00:15:54.584 --> 00:15:56.211
Joannes...

00:15:57.587 --> 00:15:58.421
Akito...

00:15:58.630 --> 00:16:00.257
Die.

00:16:03.760 --> 00:16:05.262
Die!

00:16:07.430 --> 00:16:08.640
Don't!

00:16:08.848 --> 00:16:10.433
Don't do it, Akito!

00:16:10.642 --> 00:16:14.020
There's been enough killing, Akito!

00:16:14.229 --> 00:16:17.732
If you kill him, it'll be
the same as killing yourself!

00:16:17.941 --> 00:16:20.402
Akito! Akito!

00:16:20.610 --> 00:16:24.572
Akito, live! Live with us!

00:16:26.658 --> 00:16:31.913
Now is the time when we must
claim true freedom for ourselves!

00:16:47.929 --> 00:16:49.973
| won't give up.

00:16:53.018 --> 00:16:54.936
| won't run away.

00:17:01.568 --> 00:17:03.737
My name is Leila Breisgau.

00:17:03.945 --> 00:17:06.614
And I stand with you.

00:17:08.658 --> 00:17:11.453
That's the daughter of Assemblyman Breisgau?

00:17:11.661 --> 00:17:13.621
Leila Breisgau!

00:17:13.830 --> 00:17:18.168
Leila Breisgau! Leila Breisgau!

00:17:18.376 --> 00:17:25.633
Leila Breisgau! Leila Breisgau!
Leila Breisgau! Leila Breisgau!

00:17:39.856 --> 00:17:43.443
Go ahead, shoot. I'm the one
who killed your teammate.

00:17:44.861 --> 00:17:46.363
It was me.

00:18:28.780 --> 00:18:33.326
Crap, I'm out of bullets. This just isn't my day.

00:18:36.788 --> 00:18:39.833
Right, Joannes?

00:18:45.588 --> 00:18:47.090
For the love of...

00:18:48.091 --> 00:18:49.551
What a corny plot twist.

00:18:49.759 --> 00:18:51.302
Don't poke fun, Yukiya!

00:18:51.511 --> 00:18:53.054
Fine, whatever...

00:19:21.124 --> 00:19:23.835
All Wyvern Squad beacons have vanished!

00:19:24.043 --> 00:19:26.546
--What in the world happened?
--Ark status?

00:19:26.754 --> 00:19:29.757
It disappeared at the same time!
Re-scanning now!

00:19:29.966 --> 00:19:32.469
Did the Ark explode?

00:19:35.597 --> 00:19:37.098
Akito...

00:19:39.809 --> 00:19:42.437
Why? Why have we lost their vitals?

00:19:42.645 --> 00:19:44.606
Everyone's biometrics, they're...

00:19:46.065 --> 00:19:48.359
Alexander signals aren't coming back online!

00:19:49.444 --> 00:19:51.654
It's a bug. It has to be.

00:19:54.657 --> 00:19:56.451
Olivia! Any luck?

00:19:56.659 --> 00:19:58.870
No. I can't pick up the guide, either.

00:20:07.670 --> 00:20:11.007
It's too soon to give up on the wZERO Unit!

00:20:20.767 --> 00:20:21.559
What is it?!

00:20:21.768 --> 00:20:24.437
Units with unknown IFF codes
have breached the security perimeter!

00:20:24.646 --> 00:20:25.730
They're heading our way?

00:20:25.939 --> 00:20:27.565
Yes.

00:20:27.774 --> 00:20:29.442
Most likely Britannian...

00:20:30.652 --> 00:20:32.445
...Knightmares?

00:20:45.208 --> 00:20:49.379
Let us go together, Alice.

00:20:49.587 --> 00:20:52.882
Yes, Mother.

00:21:32.088 --> 00:21:34.424
He's in an unusual hurry...

00:21:42.765 --> 00:21:44.726
Get up!

00:21:44.934 --> 00:21:47.729
The enemy is here! Issue orders!

00:21:47.937 --> 00:21:49.480
I---

00:21:49.689 --> 00:21:52.025
| can't...

00:21:54.027 --> 00:21:55.862
Suck it up!

00:21:58.281 --> 00:22:00.533
Get on your feet!

00:22:00.742 --> 00:22:03.828
You still have your duties here to perform.

00:22:06.205 --> 00:22:12.378
You have a responsibility to protect
the lives of the people here.

00:22:14.047 --> 00:22:17.759
The responsibility that comes
with being a commander.

00:22:17.967 --> 00:22:19.719
So protect them.

00:22:25.808 --> 00:22:27.769
Report enemy position!

00:22:27.977 --> 00:22:28.811
Y
es, ma'am!

00:22:29.020 --> 00:22:31.064
Leila...

00:22:31.272 --> 00:22:33.941
Enemy is to the northeast! Distance, 25km!

00:22:34.150 --> 00:22:36.527
Closing in at a speed of 140kph!

00:22:36.736 --> 00:22:39.197
140kph? Through a forest?!

00:22:39.405 --> 00:22:41.240
Your thoughts, Capt. Clement?

00:22:41.449 --> 00:22:44.744
If it's a four-legged Knightmare
that can gallop like an animal,

00:22:44.952 --> 00:22:46.788
it could run at speed on rough terrain.

00:22:46.996 --> 00:22:48.790
A four-legged Knightmare?

00:22:54.629 --> 00:22:56.130
Brother...

00:23:00.343 --> 00:23:03.471
The minefield... Activate the
minefield to the southeast.

00:23:03.680 --> 00:23:06.307
No, activate all defense systems!

00:23:07.850 --> 00:23:10.311
Use everything we have to halt their approach!

00:23:45.430 --> 00:23:47.098
They detected us already, eh?

00:23:47.306 --> 00:23:50.226
They seem smarter than
Europia's main force fools.

00:23:50.435 --> 00:23:52.478
These will be worth crushing.

00:24:08.870 --> 00:24:10.288
Enemy speed is not decreasing!

00:24:10.496 --> 00:24:12.039
Approaching minefield!

00:24:20.923 --> 00:24:22.592
Minefield reaction confirmed!

00:24:22.800 --> 00:24:24.552
Enemy rate of movement is not slowing!

00:24:24.761 --> 00:24:28.389
It's running faster than
the mines can detonate?!

00:24:41.277 --> 00:24:42.904
Enemy is changing course!

00:24:43.112 --> 00:24:45.239
It's shifting 12 degrees eastward!

00:24:46.365 --> 00:24:49.035
Lord Hyuga! You've gone out too far ahead!

00:24:49.243 --> 00:24:50.745
Lord Hyuga!

00:24:51.871 --> 00:24:54.624
Jean, support fire. These coordinates.

00:25:01.464 --> 00:25:03.591
Commencing support fire!

00:25:14.268 --> 00:25:17.772
Area around front gate hit!
System Sigma-3 is down!

00:25:17.980 --> 00:25:21.025
Defensive wall activation in 90 seconds!

00:26:13.369 --> 00:26:15.288
Lord Hyuga!

00:26:15.496 --> 00:26:17.331
Lord Hyuga, are you all right?

00:26:17.540 --> 00:26:19.292
Lord Hyuga!

00:26:21.168 --> 00:26:23.671
A wall has sprouted around the castle.

00:26:23.880 --> 00:26:25.381
Scout it.

00:26:26.507 --> 00:26:28.384
Right away, Lord Hyugal!

00:26:39.770 --> 00:26:42.982
The commander of this castle
appears to be more formidable

00:26:43.190 --> 00:26:45.318
than I thought.

00:26:46.652 --> 00:26:48.821
Defensive wall deployment
completion confirmed!

00:26:49.030 --> 00:26:51.073
We have visuals of enemy Knightmare!

00:26:52.074 --> 00:26:56.078
You'll have to try harder
than that to get over that wall.

00:26:56.287 --> 00:26:59.957
Remain at highest state of alert.
24-hour standby.

00:27:00.166 --> 00:27:03.127
Also, keep hailing Wyvern Squad.

00:27:03.336 --> 00:27:04.837
Roger.

00:27:06.380 --> 00:27:10.259
Commander, don't you think
you should get a little rest?

00:27:10.468 --> 00:27:11.385
I'm not--

00:27:11.594 --> 00:27:14.180
I'll handle things here.

00:27:14.388 --> 00:27:16.974
This will be your only chance to get any rest.

00:27:17.183 --> 00:27:18.768
It. Col. Warwick...

00:27:18.976 --> 00:27:20.061
Sara?

00:27:20.269 --> 00:27:23.064
--You and I will be staying here!
--Yes, sir!

00:27:23.272 --> 00:27:26.067
The rest of you, take a quick break!

00:27:27.234 --> 00:27:29.195
Go on, Commander.

00:27:31.113 --> 00:27:34.075
Keep an eye on things here, It. Col. Warwick.

00:27:53.928 --> 00:27:56.055
It. Colonel.

00:27:56.263 --> 00:27:58.724
Do you think Akito and the others
will manage to make it back?

00:27:58.933 --> 00:28:02.561
Come on, those guys
would never die that easily.

00:28:05.147 --> 00:28:08.776
As soon as the Order arrives,
we will launch a full-scale assault.

00:28:08.985 --> 00:28:11.445
