00:28:39.140 --> 00:28:40.641
Eliza...

00:28:42.518 --> 00:28:44.353
Akito, he...

00:28:48.149 --> 00:28:49.692
Akito...

00:29:01.203 --> 00:29:06.000
Sorry about this, Sara. You and Olivia
are the only actual military personnel.

00:29:06.208 --> 00:29:10.838
It's fine. I've been trained to
handle long-duration missions.

00:29:11.047 --> 00:29:13.174
You have, huh?

00:29:13.382 --> 00:29:18.387
Still, I'd rather not have this
castle turned into a battlefield.

00:29:35.780 --> 00:29:37.406
Suzaku...

00:29:39.825 --> 00:29:43.954
Say, Suzaku...

00:29:44.163 --> 00:29:46.082
It's hot again today, don't you think?

00:29:49.418 --> 00:29:52.338
Look, Suzaku.

00:29:55.424 --> 00:30:01.055
Look at the sunflower. Isn't it pretty?

00:30:01.263 --> 00:30:04.767
Suzaku, isn't it pretty?

00:30:52.857 --> 00:30:57.611
The Order of Michael's Black, Blue,
and White Regiments have arrived.

00:30:57.820 --> 00:31:00.197
Have all troops take up
their assigned positions.

00:31:00.406 --> 00:31:02.449
Remain on 24-hour combat alert.

00:31:02.658 --> 00:31:05.327
Tell them not to forget
that this is enemy territory.

00:31:05.536 --> 00:31:07.037
Yes, Lord!

00:31:08.706 --> 00:31:08.998
Leila Breisgau! Leila Breisgau!

00:31:08.998 --> 00:31:12.168
"United Republic of Europia
Paris" Leila Breisgau! Leila Breisgau!

00:31:12.168 --> 00:31:12.376
"United Republic of Europia
Paris"

00:31:12.376 --> 00:31:13.127
"United Republic of
Europia Paris" Leila Breisgau!

00:31:13.127 --> 00:31:14.044
Leila Breisgau!

00:31:14.253 --> 00:31:17.006
Leila Breisgau! Leila Breisgau!...

00:31:17.214 --> 00:31:19.008
Let us see Breisgau!

00:31:19.216 --> 00:31:20.467
Show us our Leila!

00:31:20.676 --> 00:31:22.595
Soldier, take these flowers!

00:31:22.803 --> 00:31:27.308
Give these flowers to Leila Breisgau!

00:31:27.516 --> 00:31:27.975
Please stand by for an emergency broadcast.

00:31:27.975 --> 00:31:30.561
