provisional government has an important message

00:31:33.105 --> 00:31:33.606
The provisional government
has an important message

00:31:33.814 --> 00:31:36.483
for you, the citizens.

00:31:43.824 --> 00:31:50.539
Citizens of Europia, there is sad news
that I must report to you.

00:31:50.748 --> 00:31:56.253
The woman who kindled the fires
of courage and hope within us all,

00:31:56.462 --> 00:32:01.008
Leila Breisgau, is dead.

00:32:02.927 --> 00:32:06.805
Leila Breisgau...

00:32:07.806 --> 00:32:09.558
...is dead.

00:32:11.518 --> 00:32:14.480
Leila Breisgau is dead.

00:32:28.702 --> 00:32:32.498
We have confirmed reports
that Weiswolf Castle Base,

00:32:32.706 --> 00:32:35.000
where Leila Breisgau was stationed,

00:32:35.209 --> 00:32:37.795
came under Euro Britannian attack
and was destroyed.

00:32:38.003 --> 00:32:41.674
Even though Weiswolf Castle
is located some 1,000km away

00:32:41.882 --> 00:32:44.551
from our border with Euro Britannia,

00:32:44.760 --> 00:32:47.596
our enemy crossed the border and attacked it.

00:32:47.805 --> 00:32:51.934
| shall continue what Leila Breisgau started.

00:32:52.935 --> 00:32:55.729
Euro Britannia killed our Leila,

00:32:55.938 --> 00:32:59.233
and I will make them pay.

00:32:59.441 --> 00:33:05.239
For untold years, our ancestors
were exploited by royals and nobility.

00:33:05.447 --> 00:33:09.952
And they righted that injustice
by means of the Revolution.

00:33:11.453 --> 00:33:13.289
Much blood was spilled in the Revolution,

00:33:13.497 --> 00:33:17.001
and those who spilled it called for still more.

00:33:18.460 --> 00:33:20.462
They tried to avenge a millennium of grudges

00:33:20.671 --> 00:33:26.385
by killing royals, killing nobles,
killing all they could.

00:33:26.593 --> 00:33:31.473
But the descendants of the kings
and nobles who escaped to the New World

00:33:31.682 --> 00:33:34.518
have been waiting for the
right time to take their revenge!

00:33:34.727 --> 00:33:40.524
Looks like Gen. Smilas' regime
has assumed full control of Europia.

00:33:42.818 --> 00:33:45.070
The descendants of those fiends

00:33:45.279 --> 00:33:48.615
will attack us to reclaim the lands
they were driven from

00:33:48.824 --> 00:33:50.451
by the Revolution!

00:33:50.659 --> 00:33:54.663
The General's cut a deal with Britannia...

00:33:54.872 --> 00:33:56.623
Do you have proof of that?

00:33:56.832 --> 00:34:01.045
| sold intel on this place to Britannia.

00:34:03.922 --> 00:34:07.551
