00:35:08.946 --> 00:35:11.156
Nobody could fault you for that!

00:35:11.365 --> 00:35:14.743
Do not hesitate to lay down your lives
in the name of freedom!

00:35:14.952 --> 00:35:18.539
Even if your life is extinguished,
the light of your resolve will shine on!

00:35:18.747 --> 00:35:21.333
Will you cling to your lives and be slaves?!

00:35:21.542 --> 00:35:23.794
| am determined to fight! For freedom!

00:35:24.002 --> 00:35:27.339
Rabble-rousers like him
are never the ones who die.

00:35:27.548 --> 00:35:29.508
They pile up corpses underfoot

00:35:29.716 --> 00:35:33.929
and use them as steppingstones
to reach the high fruit they're after.

00:35:34.138 --> 00:35:37.349
