this castle in the middle of nowhere!

00:36:35.199 --> 00:36:37.451
If you do not know why,

00:36:37.659 --> 00:36:39.745
will you be afraid to fight?

00:36:39.953 --> 00:36:43.665
You dare insult the Three
Swordmasters of Michael?

00:36:46.168 --> 00:36:50.047
Is it not poor form for a knight
to draw his sword lightly?

00:36:50.255 --> 00:36:53.300
