00:47:20.260 --> 00:47:23.596
the more convinced they are
that they themselves are happy.

00:47:23.805 --> 00:47:26.182
What contemptible creatures they are.

00:47:27.559 --> 00:47:29.269
That is so sad.

00:47:30.562 --> 00:47:32.063
What is?

00:47:32.272 --> 00:47:34.607
You are!

00:47:34.816 --> 00:47:36.317
Don't move!

00:47:37.819 --> 00:47:41.447
You're hopeless, I see.
Then believe what you will.

00:47:41.656 --> 00:47:44.909
You will be gone from
this world before he returns.

00:47:46.786 --> 00:47:48.288
Die!

00:47:57.630 --> 00:47:59.174
What was that?!

00:48:01.176 --> 00:48:03.386
Lord Hyuga!

00:48:03.595 --> 00:48:05.722
Are you all right, Lord Hyuga?

00:48:05.930 --> 00:48:07.640
Yes...

00:48:07.849 --> 00:48:08.975
What did you do?

00:48:09.184 --> 00:48:14.647
Lord Shaing, what do you hope
to attack using Apollo's Chariot?

00:48:18.818 --> 00:48:20.987
Pendragon.

00:48:21.196 --> 00:48:23.948
Pendragon, the capital of Britannia?

00:48:24.157 --> 00:48:24.991
That's right.

00:48:25.200 --> 00:48:27.243
You're planning to kill the emperor?

00:48:27.452 --> 00:48:30.330
If the emperor died now, Britannia would...

00:48:30.538 --> 00:48:34.292
No, not just Britannia. The resulting
chaos would engulf the entire world

00:48:34.500 --> 00:48:37.003
and huge wars would
break out around the planet!

00:48:37.212 --> 00:48:42.675
That's precisely what I want.
| want the world to be buried in corpses.

00:48:42.884 --> 00:48:45.345
You're insane...

00:48:45.553 --> 00:48:49.641
| do not accept your surrender.
We will conquer that castle

00:48:49.849 --> 00:48:52.352
and kill everyone in it!

00:48:52.560 --> 00:48:56.105
Anything I require, I will take by force!

00:48:56.314 --> 00:48:59.484
Jean. Kill those two.

00:49:00.985 --> 00:49:03.404
Commander, I'm sorry.

00:49:03.613 --> 00:49:06.366
Surrender by yourself!

00:49:06.574 --> 00:49:11.704
Not even a guy like me could
do something that shameful.

00:49:11.913 --> 00:49:13.456
Stand back.

00:49:34.769 --> 00:49:37.021
Things look dicey down there.

00:49:37.230 --> 00:49:39.607
Kill them all.

00:49:39.816 --> 00:49:43.236
But Lord Hyuga, we can still
use them if they're alive!

00:49:46.990 --> 00:49:49.284
--Shoot them dead!
--Yes, sir!

00:49:55.290 --> 00:49:57.458
You don't know when to give up, do you?

00:50:04.465 --> 00:50:05.967
Lord Hyuga...

00:50:08.928 --> 00:50:10.430
Take cover!

00:50:19.480 --> 00:50:22.191
Am I crazy, or was that
an explosion shockwave?

00:50:22.400 --> 00:50:25.236
Yeah, I think it must have been.

00:50:25.445 --> 00:50:27.613
I'm receiving some kind of transmission!

00:50:27.822 --> 00:50:29.782
The Alexander beacons are back online?

00:50:29.991 --> 00:50:31.409
Whose Alexander?

00:50:31.617 --> 00:50:33.453
Synchronized!

00:50:33.661 --> 00:50:36.664
Guys! Do you read me?

00:50:36.873 --> 00:50:41.461
Wyvern Squad here! If you read me, respond!

00:50:41.669 --> 00:50:42.628
Yukiya!

00:50:42.837 --> 00:50:46.466
Hey, Sara! Long time, no hear!
You're sounding well.

00:50:56.851 --> 00:50:57.685
What was that?

00:50:57.894 --> 00:50:59.562
From overhead, huh?

00:50:59.771 --> 00:51:00.688
Lord Hyuga?

00:51:00.897 --> 00:51:03.441
Akito, eh?

00:51:03.649 --> 00:51:05.610
He's alive...

00:51:05.818 --> 00:51:08.321
Did you see a flash of light just now?

00:51:08.529 --> 00:51:10.323
Yes, I'm sure of it.

00:51:10.531 --> 00:51:12.325
What do you suppose it was?

00:51:20.750 --> 00:51:22.418
An Alexander!

00:51:23.628 --> 00:51:25.338
Akito!

00:51:25.546 --> 00:51:27.882
Akito? It's Akito?!

00:51:28.091 --> 00:51:29.509
But how?!

00:51:29.717 --> 00:51:31.677
Why didn't you radio us before now?!

00:51:31.886 --> 00:51:35.348
Sorry! "To deceive one's enemies,
begin with one's allies” and all that.

00:51:35.556 --> 00:51:37.683
--That's mean!
--We were worried sick!

00:51:37.892 --> 00:51:41.479
They're... They're all alive. What a relief!

00:51:41.687 --> 00:51:45.233
--It sure is, Joe.
--Don't cry, Joe!

00:51:45.441 --> 00:51:47.944
What wonderful news, Leila.

00:51:52.156 --> 00:51:54.075
| see it, Akito!

00:51:55.910 --> 00:51:57.537
Brother...

00:51:57.745 --> 00:51:59.247
Akito!

00:52:03.418 --> 00:52:06.379
Tell me, why are we trusting that guy?

00:52:06.587 --> 00:52:08.464
That Ashley guy, I mean.

00:52:08.673 --> 00:52:11.592
Jealousy is an ugly thing, Ayano.

00:52:12.593 --> 00:52:14.971
Who's being jealous of who?!

00:52:15.179 --> 00:52:17.932
You're an open book, Ayano.

00:52:18.141 --> 00:52:20.351
If you don't control your emotions better,

00:52:20.560 --> 00:52:23.104
you'll never be able to play the game of love.

00:52:24.105 --> 00:52:26.315
| never imagined the day would come

00:52:26.524 --> 00:52:28.192
when I'd hear those words from you!

00:52:28.401 --> 00:52:31.320
Ayano, it's time. Let's bail.

00:52:31.529 --> 00:52:34.699
Yukiya, when we get back,
we're gonna have a nice, long chat!

00:52:34.907 --> 00:52:36.909
Yeah, yeah...

00:52:37.118 --> 00:52:39.537
We'll be waiting for you on the ground, Yukiya!

00:52:39.745 --> 00:52:42.874
Roger that. I'll bail out as planned,
so I'll see you later.

00:52:43.082 --> 00:52:44.876
Yukiya.

00:52:45.084 --> 00:52:46.711
Don't keep us waiting.

00:52:55.553 --> 00:52:56.971
Well, Jean?

00:52:57.180 --> 00:52:59.432
Isn't it exactly as I said?

00:53:03.186 --> 00:53:05.771
Oh, crap! It's a Knightmare!

00:53:10.109 --> 00:53:11.611
Commander!

00:53:18.951 --> 00:53:21.579
It's the Vercingetorix! Akito!

00:53:23.623 --> 00:53:25.124
Commander?

00:53:27.627 --> 00:53:29.128
Akito...

00:53:36.010 --> 00:53:39.472
Lord Shaing! You've got some nerve,

00:53:39.680 --> 00:53:41.933
blowing up the Ark while I was still on it!

00:53:43.726 --> 00:53:44.977
Jean! Watch it!

00:53:45.186 --> 00:53:48.439
Shut your mouth, traitor! I'll kill you myself!

00:53:50.566 --> 00:53:53.569
Get real! You're the traitor!

00:53:53.778 --> 00:53:54.904
Who the hell is that?

00:53:55.112 --> 00:53:56.906
It. Col., get to the boat!

00:53:57.114 --> 00:53:59.200
Hey, wait a damn minute!

00:54:00.201 --> 00:54:02.036
Pops! Akito sent me!

00:54:02.245 --> 00:54:04.664
Let's get out of here!

00:54:04.872 --> 00:54:06.749
Who are you?

00:54:07.875 --> 00:54:10.836
You haven't changed one bit since then.

00:54:11.045 --> 00:54:13.631
You're still a child.

00:54:13.839 --> 00:54:16.092
You have no idea how the world works.

00:54:16.300 --> 00:54:18.844
You're wrong, Brother.

00:54:19.053 --> 00:54:21.305
Fighting can't change anything.

00:54:21.514 --> 00:54:25.351
| can't allow the people of
the world to go on following

00:54:25.560 --> 00:54:28.396
the same foolish rulers.

00:54:28.604 --> 00:54:30.523
Akito,

00:54:30.731 --> 00:54:34.360
if you are my little brother,
you ought to understand

00:54:34.569 --> 00:54:37.029
what I am trying to do.

00:54:37.238 --> 00:54:38.739
Brother...

00:54:44.453 --> 00:54:45.997
Akito!

00:54:49.917 --> 00:54:50.876
Commander?

00:54:51.085 --> 00:54:54.714
Don't do it, Akito! You're not like him!

00:54:54.922 --> 00:54:57.466
Akito, kill that woman!

00:54:59.010 --> 00:55:02.096
No one can give you orders but me.

00:55:02.305 --> 00:55:03.931
Kill her!

00:55:10.771 --> 00:55:12.273
Kill her!

00:55:31.792 --> 00:55:32.877
Commander.

00:55:33.085 --> 00:55:34.587
Akito!

00:55:35.755 --> 00:55:37.256
I'm getting us out of here.

00:55:44.805 --> 00:55:46.766
Hang on tight.

00:56:04.158 --> 00:56:05.660
It. Col. Warwick!

00:56:05.868 --> 00:56:08.412
Akito, jump on!

00:56:09.413 --> 00:56:11.916
Commander, hold on.

00:56:12.124 --> 00:56:13.709
I'm going to jump.

00:56:18.255 --> 00:56:23.678
Do you still remember

00:56:23.886 --> 00:56:29.266
the dream we had that day?

00:56:29.475 --> 00:56:35.064
As a cold wind blew,

00:56:35.272 --> 00:56:39.652
birds took flight into the sky,

00:56:39.860 --> 00:56:41.237
where a line of clouds traced an arc

00:56:41.237 --> 00:56:44.115
where a line of clouds traced an arc
Pops! Punch it!

00:56:44.323 --> 00:56:47.034
That stretched endlessly to the east. Sure, but
it's a little cold to be out for a cruise...

00:56:47.034 --> 00:56:51.831
that stretched endlessly to the east.

00:56:52.039 --> 00:56:58.212
Please never let me go.

00:56:58.212 --> 00:56:58.504
Please never let me go.
The Commander and an Alexander?!

00:56:58.504 --> 00:56:58.713
The Commander and an Alexander?!

00:56:58.713 --> 00:57:00.631
I wanted to love you deeply without living
like blazes. The Commander and an Alexander?!

00:57:00.631 --> 00:57:00.840
I wanted to love you deeply
without living like blazes.

00:57:00.840 --> 00:57:02.425
I wanted to love you deeply
without living like blazes. Yes!

00:57:02.425 --> 00:57:03.217
I wanted to love you deeply
without living like blazes.

00:57:03.426 --> 00:57:06.053
I simply wanted

00:57:06.053 --> 00:57:06.429
I simply wanted
Leila! Leila!

00:57:06.429 --> 00:57:06.637
Leila! Leila!

00:57:06.637 --> 00:57:08.931
To go on grasping your hand in silence
Leila! Leila!

00:57:08.931 --> 00:57:11.100
To go on grasping your hand in silence

00:57:11.308 --> 00:57:17.148
as if to protect you. (Please never let me go.)

00:57:17.356 --> 00:57:23.696
Farewell, you beautiful person.

00:57:23.904 --> 00:57:28.492
You, who are my tomorrow,

00:57:28.701 --> 00:57:36.876
brought with you a light

00:57:37.084 --> 00:57:39.712
that transformed into hope no matter what.

00:57:39.920 --> 00:57:45.509
Water flows, nourishing all,

00:57:45.718 --> 00:57:57.480
and this world remains green again today.

00:58:14.997 --> 00:58:19.835
| hate to do this, but it's war...

00:58:39.230 --> 00:58:43.818
Sorry, but I have teammates to protect.

00:58:45.486 --> 00:58:48.781
--Company 2's been wiped out!
--All squads, report in!

00:58:48.989 --> 00:58:50.282
Calm yourselves!

00:58:50.491 --> 00:58:53.702
--A second one is coming!
--Lord Shaing...

00:58:53.911 --> 00:58:57.122
The enemy is above the clouds.
I'm sending you the coordinates.

00:58:57.331 --> 00:58:59.583
Shoot it down with a Canterbury.

00:59:19.019 --> 00:59:20.521
Yukiya!

00:59:22.523 --> 00:59:24.316
Yukiya...

00:59:24.525 --> 00:59:26.777
Yukiya!

00:59:28.237 --> 00:59:30.948
Akito.

00:59:31.156 --> 00:59:34.034
I'm going to kill...

00:59:34.243 --> 00:59:37.496
...everyone that you love.

00:59:37.705 --> 00:59:40.833
Right in front of you.

00:59:56.515 --> 00:59:59.268
"Final Episode"
